      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Alderic",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Highest lord of the dwarf lords, he is known for his intensity in battle and his courage in the face of overwhelming odds. He once fought seven days and nights against the mighty red dragon ARFURUZON to finally defeat him.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thorne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without his knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sigulf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thorne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf Gast",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erwylle",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Jona\u0027ath",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kera\u0027anil",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thistle",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf_Dark",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf \n\u0022There is room for one more! Join us! As you try to enlist us in the Elven Alliance, we in turn command that you join us! None can deny the strength of the Dragon. Follow us and worship the terrifying beast.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022You are wrong! We have not come here to enlist or persuade the likes of you to join the Elven Alliance! I have been sent to defeat your sadistic followers! The time for talking is passed prepare for war!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Oracle Elf \n\u0022My Liege, here this pond will heal our weak! Use it wisely for we are in a hostile realm!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wyndor Dragon Of The South Sea",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Healing",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Helthmor Dragon Of Realm ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Dragon",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022There is some strange writing on the statute! I can only understand some of the text. Something about whomever reaches this Altar will cause mountains to fall! From the rubble a beast will emerge who will be loyal!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans Heal ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf King \n\u0022Wotan smiles on this day. Behold this skeleton. A great champion of the Mountain Clans is buried here. The magic that flows will heal our wounded. Use this well for we are engaged is great battle.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans infinite healing ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_elf Doragon ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022At last we have found the center piece of Doragon\u0027s Cult. This structure will grant us what we need to win this battle. It reads that Mountains shall fall and a great beast that was wild will become tame and loyal! We will crush the Elven Alliance!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Dark Elf Warning ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf Reaper \n\u0022Prepare to be a worthy sacrifice to Doragon\u0027s memory! The Mountain Clans will be useful to us only as a sacrifice! Prepare to meet Doragon!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cult Elf Attack ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Doragon\u0027s Cult \n\u0022Let us sacrifice the invaders to the power of Doragon!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cult Elf attack enabled ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolf Den Curse ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Great! It would appear that there is a curse upon this place. Anyone who loots this ruin will unleash an evil spirit on the land! We must be prepared to face whatever shall come after us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolve Den Spirit Wolves ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Win ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolf Spawn ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Doragons Curse Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Doragon\u0027s Cult Oracle Elf \n\u0022Your presence in our realm has angered us! In Doragon\u0027s memory we will sacrifice each one of your people! Hail to the power of Doragon!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Doragons Curse ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Doragons Curse enabled ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day one ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hunter  \n\u0022We have to be on the look out. This realm is still wild and superstitious. We have to watch out for the wolves.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Veteran \n\u0022The forces of the Mountain Clans will conquer this realm. I hear the sound of wolves! These wild creatures will attack at a moment\u0027s notice be on your guard!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves_Doragon City messag",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Gather round! The Elven Alliance must defeat this cult! I have found among the ashes that there is an monumen dedicated to Doragon. We must find this monument it may be the only way for us to conquer this realm and drive out the Cult!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Doragons Cult Castl",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This city falls to us with ease! In thier defeat the citizens speak of the Doragon monument! This is the source of the Cult\u0027s power. We must find this place and claim the power for ourselves before our enemies do!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN003c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Doragon City ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This city falls and we are closer to our ultimate victory!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves_Doragons Cult ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This battle rages on! Soon we will have conquered the realm!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Archon Castle ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We now possess a large city! We cannot afford to lose this city! The Cult still gathers and we must continue to fight!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN003f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sentry Castle ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This is excellent! Soon we will have conquered the realm! We must remain cautious. The wolves and Doragon\u0027s Cult are still out there in the darkness!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0042",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf Reaper",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0044",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S214SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S214UN0045",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Wolf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
